---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Agentic Lab" description="Playable models, outreach tools and live experiments with AI agents, built by Mudit Joshi.">
  <div class="wrap page">
    <header class="page-head">
      <h1>Agentic Lab</h1>
      <p>Things to play with and learn from: small models of how living systems work, outreach tools for teaching, and, soon, experiments with AI agents doing real research. Everything here is free to use in classes and at events.</p>
    </header>

    <article class="feature">
      <a class="preview" href="/lab/follow-the-rain" aria-label="Open Follow the rain">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 400 230" aria-hidden="true">
          <rect class="fr-ground" width="400" height="230" />
          {Array.from({ length: 15 * 9 }, (_, i) => {
            const x = i % 15, y = Math.floor(i / 15);
            const d1 = Math.hypot(x - 4.5, y - 3.5), d2 = Math.hypot(x - 11, y - 6);
            const g = Math.max(0, 1 - d1 / 4.2) + Math.max(0, 1 - d2 / 3.2);
            return <rect class="fr-sq" x={x * 26.67 + 1} y={y * 25.56 + 1} width="24.67" height="23.56" style={`opacity:${Math.min(1, g).toFixed(2)}`} />;
          })}
          <g class="fr-stay"><path d="M222 108h20v13h-20zM216 109l16-15 16 15z" /></g>
          <g class="fr-move"><path d="M104 96l14-23 14 23z" /><path d="M286 168l14-23 14 23z" /><path d="M146 122l14-23 14 23z" /></g>
        </svg>
      </a>
      <div class="txt">
        <p class="kind">Playable explanation</p>
        <h2><a href="/lab/follow-the-rain">Follow the rain</a></h2>
        <p>Why have herders on the dry edge of the Sahara kept moving for 7,000 years, and what happens when they can't? Steer a herd through patchy rain, bet on two villages, flip a coin for a thousand families, and then try to bring fifteen families through the real Sahel drought of 1968 to 1993.</p>
        <p class="for">Outreach for the AGRI-DRY network. Ten minutes, on a phone or a laptop.</p>
        <a class="btn" href="/lab/follow-the-rain">Open Follow the rain</a>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="feature">
      <a class="preview" href="/lab/patch" aria-label="Open Patch">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 400 230" aria-hidden="true">
          <rect class="p-sky" width="400" height="130" />
          <circle class="p-sun" cx="330" cy="44" r="20" />
          <text class="p-co2" x="60" y="52">CO₂</text><text class="p-co2" x="150" y="78">CO₂</text><text class="p-co2" x="245" y="40">CO₂</text>
          <rect class="p-soil" y="130" width="400" height="100" />
          <rect class="p-soilc" y="134" width="400" height="22" />
          <rect class="p-water" y="192" width="400" height="38" />
          {Array.from({ length: 13 }, (_, i) => {
            const x = 18 + i * 29;
            const h = 34 + ((i * 37) % 26);
            return (
              <g>
                <path class="p-blade" d={`M${x},130 Q${x - 4},${130 - h * 0.6} ${x - 9},${130 - h}`} />
                <path class="p-blade" d={`M${x + 3},130 Q${x + 4},${130 - h * 0.7} ${x + 6},${130 - h * 1.1}`} />
                <path class="p-blade" d={`M${x + 6},130 Q${x + 10},${130 - h * 0.5} ${x + 16},${130 - h * 0.85}`} />
                <path class="p-root" d={`M${x + 3},132 q-4,24 -1,48 M${x + 3},132 q8,18 10,36`} />
              </g>
            );
          })}
        </svg>
      </a>
      <div class="txt">
        <p class="kind">Playable explanation</p>
        <h2><a href="/lab/patch">Patch</a></h2>
        <p>How do scientists work out what a changing climate does to forests, grasslands and harvests? Patch is a teaching aid that shows how a process-based ecosystem model works. Look inside one, then run scenarios, test hypotheses and switch processes off in four ecosystems from Niger to the Amazon. Outreach material for AGRI-DRY.</p>
        <p class="for">For curious visitors, classrooms and science fairs.</p>
        <a class="btn" href="/lab/patch">Open Patch</a>
      </div>
    </article>


    <article class="feature">
      <a class="preview" href="/lab/sahara" aria-label="Open Ten thousand years in the Sahara">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 400 230" aria-hidden="true">
          <rect class="sg-land" width="400" height="230" />
          <rect class="sg-belt" y="96" width="400" height="134" />
          <rect class="sg-sea" width="400" height="12" />
          <path class="sg-river" d="M372 230 C366 170 378 120 368 60 C362 30 372 20 366 12" />
          <path class="sg-river" d="M0 140 C40 128 66 108 96 108 C128 108 140 130 160 150 C172 164 170 196 186 230" />
          <ellipse class="sg-lake" cx="222" cy="136" rx="26" ry="14" />
          <g class="sg-links"><path d="M296 70 L278 150 M296 70 L222 82 L180 54 L96 108 L222 136 L216 196 M96 108 L136 160 L216 196 M222 82 L222 136 M296 70 L366 60" /></g>
          <g class="sg-dots"><circle cx="296" cy="70" r="6" /><circle cx="222" cy="82" r="6" /><circle cx="180" cy="54" r="6" /><circle cx="96" cy="108" r="6" /><circle cx="222" cy="136" r="6" /><circle cx="136" cy="160" r="6" /><circle cx="216" cy="196" r="6" /><circle cx="366" cy="60" r="6" /></g>
          <circle class="sg-me" cx="296" cy="70" r="13" />
        </svg>
      </a>
      <div class="txt">
        <p class="kind">Game</p>
        <h2><a href="/lab/sahara">Ten thousand years in the Sahara</a></h2>
        <p>Lead a group of people from the Green Sahara 10,500 years ago to today. Choose how they find food and water, where they live, who they trade with and what they learn, as the rains retreat and history unfolds around them.</p>
        <p class="for">Two modes: a story mode for younger players, and a full game for students and adults.</p>
        <a class="btn" href="/lab/sahara">Play</a>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="feature">
      <a class="preview" href="/lab/dryland-runner" aria-label="Open Dryland Runner">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 400 230" aria-hidden="true">
          <defs><linearGradient id="dr-g" x1="0" x2="1"><stop offset="0" class="d-wet" /><stop offset="1" class="d-dry" /></linearGradient></defs>
          <rect class="d-sky" width="400" height="150" />
          <path class="d-far" d="M0,150 C40,118 80,124 120,132 C160,140 190,120 230,126 C270,112 300,96 330,110 C360,96 380,104 400,100 L400,160 L0,160Z" />
          <ellipse class="d-lake" cx="80" cy="150" rx="70" ry="7" />
          <rect y="150" width="400" height="80" fill="url(#dr-g)" />
          <rect class="d-path" y="176" width="400" height="6" />
          <g class="d-tree"><rect x="38" y="122" width="3" height="28" /><ellipse cx="40" cy="120" rx="22" ry="6" /></g>
          <g class="d-tree"><rect x="128" y="128" width="3" height="22" /><ellipse cx="130" cy="126" rx="17" ry="5" /></g>
          <path class="d-dune" d="M300,176 Q318,150 334,156 L360,176Z" />
          <g class="d-ink"><circle cx="212" cy="139" r="5" /><path d="M211,145 L213,160 M213,160 L205,176 M213,160 L222,174 M212,148 L204,162" /></g>
          <ellipse class="d-pot" cx="212" cy="129" rx="6" ry="4.5" />
          <g class="d-cow"><ellipse cx="170" cy="160" rx="13" ry="7" /><ellipse cx="185" cy="156" rx="5" ry="3.5" /></g>
          <path class="d-drop" d="M262,158 c6,8 5,13 0,13 c-5,0 -6,-5 0,-13Z" />
        </svg>
      </a>
      <div class="txt">
        <p class="kind">Game</p>
        <h2><a href="/lab/dryland-runner">Dryland Runner</a></h2>
        <p>Ten thousand years ago the Sahara was green. Then, slowly, it turned to desert. Choose how your people get food and water and deal with their neighbours, and see if they make it. What worked yesterday may not work tomorrow.</p>
        <p class="for">For classrooms, outreach events and anyone curious about how people lived with climate change.</p>
        <a class="btn" href="/lab/dryland-runner">Play Dryland Runner</a>
      </div>
    </article>

    <section class="workshop" aria-labelledby="ws-h">
      <h2 id="ws-h">In the workshop</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Overshoot</strong><span>A one-button game about harvesting faster than nature regrows.</span></li>
        <li><strong>Tipping Point</strong><span>A lake that flips from clear to green, and the long way back.</span></li>
        <li><strong>A live agent experiment</strong><span>AI agents carrying out a real study, with every run logged here.</span></li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .feature { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.1fr) minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 2rem 2.5rem; align-items: center; padding-bottom: 3rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .preview { display: block; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .preview svg { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; }
  .p-sky { fill: #d6e7ea; } .p-sun { fill: #f2b84b; } .p-soil { fill: #8b6c4c; } .p-soilc { fill: #3e2d1f; opacity: 0.75; }
  .p-water { fill: #6fa6c4; } .p-blade { fill: none; stroke: #4c8a3a; stroke-width: 2.5; stroke-linecap: round; }
  .p-root { fill: none; stroke: #e8dcc4; stroke-width: 1.2; opacity: 0.8; } .p-co2 { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 10px; fill: #4b5d63; }
  :global([data-theme='night']) .p-sky { fill: #1b2b33; }
  :global([data-theme='night']) .p-soil { fill: #5a4632; }
  :global([data-theme='night']) .p-blade { stroke: #7fbf72; }
  :global([data-theme='night']) .p-co2 { fill: #a9b6aa; }
  .feature + .feature { padding-top: 3rem; }
  .fr-ground { fill: #e6dfd0; } .fr-sq { fill: #3c7a3e; } .fr-stay path { fill: #a85a06; stroke: #fff; stroke-width: 2; stroke-linejoin: round; } .fr-move path { fill: #00789a; stroke: #fff; stroke-width: 2; stroke-linejoin: round; }
  :global([data-theme='night']) .fr-ground { fill: #2b2a24; } :global([data-theme='night']) .fr-sq { fill: #a9cf7c; }
  :global([data-theme='night']) .fr-stay path { fill: #c98427; stroke: #18231c; } :global([data-theme='night']) .fr-move path { fill: #2a9cba; stroke: #18231c; }
  .sg-land { fill: #ead6aa; } .sg-belt { fill: #9cbb72; opacity: 0.75; } .sg-sea { fill: #8fc0d8; } .sg-river { stroke: #3d8bbd; stroke-width: 4; fill: none; } .sg-lake { fill: #3d8bbd; }
  .sg-links path { stroke: #11252b; stroke-width: 1.4; stroke-dasharray: 4 5; fill: none; opacity: 0.6; }
  .sg-dots circle { fill: #fff; stroke: #11252b; stroke-width: 2; } .sg-me { fill: none; stroke: #a85a06; stroke-width: 3.5; }
  :global([data-theme='night']) .sg-land { fill: #3c3322; } :global([data-theme='night']) .sg-belt { fill: #4f7a43; }
  :global([data-theme='night']) .sg-sea { fill: #2f5466; } :global([data-theme='night']) .sg-links path { stroke: #e6ece4; }
  :global([data-theme='night']) .sg-dots circle { fill: #18231c; stroke: #e6ece4; } :global([data-theme='night']) .sg-me { stroke: #e8b25c; }

  .d-sky { fill: #d7e8e6; } .d-far { fill: #a9c4a0; } .d-lake { fill: #5b9cbf; } .d-path { fill: #9b7b52; opacity: 0.6; }
  .d-wet { stop-color: #7c9a52; } .d-dry { stop-color: #d2a564; }
  .d-tree rect { fill: #5c4630; } .d-tree ellipse { fill: #3f6b3a; } .d-dune { fill: #c99a55; }
  .d-ink circle { fill: #11252b; } .d-ink path { fill: none; stroke: #11252b; stroke-width: 3; stroke-linecap: round; }
  .d-pot { fill: #b36a2b; } .d-cow ellipse { fill: #f2ede2; stroke: #5a4434; stroke-width: 1.2; } .d-drop { fill: #1f6fa3; }
  :global([data-theme='night']) .d-sky { fill: #18272a; }
  :global([data-theme='night']) .d-far { fill: #2c4632; }
  :global([data-theme='night']) .d-wet { stop-color: #334f2d; }
  :global([data-theme='night']) .d-dry { stop-color: #6e5633; }
  :global([data-theme='night']) .d-ink circle { fill: #e6ece4; }
  :global([data-theme='night']) .d-ink path { stroke: #e6ece4; }
  :global([data-theme='night']) .d-drop { fill: #7cc0ea; }
  .kind { color: var(--ochre); font-size: 0.92rem; margin-bottom: 0.3rem; }
  .txt h2 { font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 2.8rem); margin-bottom: 0.4em; }
  .txt h2 a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
  .for { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.95rem; }
  .workshop { padding-top: 2.5rem; }
  .workshop h2 { font-size: 1.4rem; }
  .workshop ul { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; display: grid; gap: 0; }
  .workshop li { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 14rem 1fr; gap: 0.5rem 2rem; padding: 0.85rem 0; border-bottom: 1px dotted var(--line); }
  .workshop strong { font-weight: 500; }
  .workshop span { color: var(--muted); }
  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .feature { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .workshop li { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 0.1rem; }
  }
</style>
